        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Dyer Baizley, Gina Gleason, Pete Adams\n- Bands: Baroness, Torche\n- Places: Savannah, Georgia, Lexington, Virginia\n- Roles: singer, lead guitarist, artwork and design\n\nFacts:\n- Baroness is an American heavy metal band from Savannah, Georgia.\n- The original members of Baroness grew up together in Lexington, Virginia.\n- John Dyer Baizley is the singer of Baroness.\n- John Dyer Baizley created the artwork and design for the Torche EP In Return.\n- Gina Gleason is the current lead guitarist for Baroness.\n- Gina Gleason replaced Pete Adams as Baroness lead guitarist.",
